This confirms the claim precisely: HERMES_PROFILE is used as an "author label" in kanban worker context (kanban_db.py, kanban.py), NOT as a profile selector. The profile selector `_apply_profile_override` reads argv `-p` → active_profile file → HERMES_HOME env, and does NOT read HERMES_PROFILE. The comment in kanban_db.py even says: "HERMES_PROFILE is the author the kanban_comment tool defaults to."

So the mechanism claim is 100% verified. The fix is real.

