The query returned nothing, probably because `started_at` column stores an epoch integer, not a datetime string. In my earlier query I did `ts_to_local(started_at)` and got '2026-09-02 01:38:35', which suggests started_at is an integer epoch. So filtering by string comparison won't work. Let me fix the query by ordering and using Python-side filtering.
